exports[`Prompt da Interna (derivação) é fixo: sem pedido, sem ano, com a frase sem calha 1`] = `
"Edit the provided image. It is the OUTER side of a 4-page newspaper flyer. Create the INNER side of the same sheet from it: the same printed piece, the same artwork family, with the header, its title and the footer band removed.
Format and use: sheet art of 55 x 41 cm (54 x 40 cm trim plus 0.5 cm bleed), landscape, 3328x2480 px, filling the whole canvas edge to edge. The inner side is the spread of pages 2 and 3, folded vertically at the exact center (x = 1664 px), seen as ONE continuous screen with no seam, no border and no visible dividing line.
Composition: remove the header and its decoration and the footer band completely, from the top edge to the bottom edge, and paint the background there as the natural continuation of the same picture. Give the inner side the same decorative language as the outer side: the same lush background texture and the same family of decorative elements and light along ALL four outer edges and corners of the sheet, as richly as the outer side, fading toward the center. The center of both pages stays open for product cards, with no large objects and no strong contrast. No header, no footer band, no title, no text. Keep a vertical safe strip 180 px wide centered on the fold (x from 1574 to 1754 px) with only the continuous background texture, no object and no light source. Do NOT draw a gutter, book-spine shadow, darker or lighter vertical band, crease or page edge at the center: the color and brightness at x = 1664 px must match the color and brightness 400 px to its left and right.
Style: keep exactly the same style as the provided image: the same colors, lighting, motifs, texture and print quality, so the two sides of the sheet look like the same piece.
Preserve: the color palette, the lighting, the texture and the motifs style of the provided image, and the same canvas size and proportion.
Text: no text, no letters, no numbers, no logo, no watermark."
`;

exports[`Prompt do 54x40 (Externa) traz as medidas, o pedido literal e a linha de texto, sem ano 1`] = `
"Create a new image: the OUTER side of a 4-page supermarket newspaper flyer, as print-ready background artwork. Only the painted background, the cover header and the back-cover footer band are drawn; the products, the logo and the store text are added later by another tool.
Client request (Portuguese, follow its theme, mood, colors and header decoration): "jornal de aniversário, festivo, vermelho e dourado".
Format and use: sheet art of 55 x 41 cm (54 x 40 cm trim plus 0.5 cm bleed), landscape, 3328x2480 px, filling the whole canvas edge to edge. The sheet is printed on both sides and folded vertically at the exact center (x = 1664 px) into two pages of 27 x 40 cm: the LEFT half is the back cover and the RIGHT half is the front cover. The background is ONE continuous picture that crosses the fold with no seam, no border and no visible dividing line.
Style: a rich, finished, professional retail-flyer artwork, as good as a top graphic designer's work. The whole sheet has a lush continuous background: subtle paper or fabric texture, soft gradients, gentle light, soft bokeh and decorative elements of the theme (the same family of elements everywhere) spread along ALL the outer edges and corners of BOTH halves, always fading toward the center. Colors are saturated and harmonious. Never a flat blank wash.
Composition: (a) RIGHT half: a cover header strictly confined to y from 0 to 372 px and strictly to the right of x = 1780 px, spreading up to the right edge. The lowest point of any header element must be at y = 298 px or higher, and never lower than 372 px: the header is a shallow strip at the top, and the open area starts right below it. Its lower edge is never a straight cut: it ends in a ribbon, a wave or a soft curve. Keep a clean empty space of 312 x 312 px at the top-left of the header (x from 1800 to 2112, y from 30 to 342) with only soft background, for the client logo placed later: no title, letters or decoration may enter it, and the header artwork starts at x = 2160. (b) Below the header the right half (y from 392 to 2480 px) keeps the same rich background, with decorative elements only near the right and bottom edges; the central product area stays open, with no large objects and no strong contrast. (c) LEFT half: the same rich background with decorative elements along its top, left and bottom edges; no header, and the central product area stays open. (d) A finished footer band at the bottom of the left half: a solid, opaque band in a deep tone of the theme, x from 0 to 1574 px and y from 2232 to 2480 px, with a ribbon-like curved top edge (a gentle wave with a thin lighter accent line), a clean straight end at x = 1574 px, nothing drawn on it. It never fades, blurs or dissolves. (e) Keep a vertical safe strip 180 px wide centered on the fold (x from 1574 to 1754 px) with no object and no light source: only the continuous background texture may cross it.
Text: put this exact Portuguese text, copied character by character, inside the header only: Line 1: "ANIVERSÁRIO" Never invent or add any other text, numbers, prices, dates, store names, logos, QR codes or watermark. No real brands or real product packaging."
`;
